# Un-ignore source/test files that merely contain "private" in the name (NOT secrets).
# The broad *private* rule above was silently dropping these, which broke the build.
!heres_program/programs/heres_program/src/instructions/prepare_private_distribution.rs
!scripts/test-private-distribution.mjs

